{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/09/11/0472158/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カープ優勝おめでとうございます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局詳しくはなれなかったけれど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島県民としてやはり嬉しい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カープ女子が流行ったりして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それこそ私が上京してから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本中でブームが起こったりしましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ広島に住んでた頃からずっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元愛、郷土愛みたいなものは根強くあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カープ帽を被った小学生の男子たちを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも街中で見かけたなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島に住む野球少年たちの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"憧れの存在、それは今も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと変わらないんだと思います( ˇωˇ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛 広島の街は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大盛り上がりだと聞いています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと真っ赤なんでしょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感動をありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/09/11/0472158/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜の夜は、らじらー！サンデー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回のゲストは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"